 ## Background
-Originated in the context of adapting 3D-aware generative models (like StyleGAN or DA3) for Gaussian Splatting [S1]. The method was introduced to address the fundamental mismatch between NeRF-style local density/color representations and the extended, oriented nature of 3D Gaussians [S1]. It is used in feed-forward 3DGS reconstruction pipelines where a pre-trained 3D generator serves as the backbone [S1][S2, unofficial].
